 {"q": "What is unusual about how Exodus 1 names people?", "options": ["It names every Pharaoh", "It names the two midwives, Shiphrah and Puah, but not the mighty Pharaoh", "It names no women", "It names Moses' parents first"], "answer": 1, "why": "The humble resisters are remembered by name; the god-king is not."},
